  "description": "A compact full-body Holtzman field generator for settlements and protected travel. Its lighter construction reduces weight and cost, but its energy reserve and recharge are lower than a standard belt. Fast projectiles and hurried melee blows are stopped; a skilled, deliberate slow blade can penetrate. Heat, explosions and EMP bypass the field. The field automatically rises when drafted, fighting or attacked. It lowers during ranged aiming, bursts and recovery so the wearer can shoot, then returns if combat continues. Blocked impacts postpone recharge for twelve seconds. Disable it on exposed sand: its emissions attract Makers. Lasgun contact causes a dangerous local overload. This civilian configuration is a frontier adaptation.",
