    "overview": {
      "body": "Uses the shared Holtzman rules: fast impacts stop, skilled deliberate blades and specialist drilling darts can penetrate, and blocked hits delay recharge by twelve seconds. A procedural contour follows the rendered wearer, with blue blocking and red penetration reactions. The native utility slot prevents stacking with another shield belt. The supplied final startup and breach recordings handle activation/recovery and penetration/overload; ordinary blocked hits do not play breach. The enabled belt raises in combat and lowers for ranged aiming, bursts and recovery; idle equipment is ready but inactive. Skilled blades default to automatic fencing against active shields. Inspect text distinguishes energy units from percentage."
    }
  },
